## The problem

Freight invoices had to be checked by hand against a contract rate table, where the correct rate changes with the diesel price.

## What I built

A web app that reads freight invoices, looks up the contract rate for each shipment, including the right diesel-price band, and highlights any line that doesn't match. The team can fix billing errors before payment instead of after.
